%% signature and semantics below. E6 granted approval-IN-PRINCIPLE only — NOT approval of
%% this concrete language change.
%%
%% The SHIPPED MVP routing evaluator is the fixed C# matcher:
%%   csharp/glp_crdtmsg/route/PolicyMatcher.cs  (Contract C23) — {targets, waypoints, excludes},
%%   unsatisfiable → fail loud. That data-field matcher delivers the routing behaviour regardless
%%   of whether this guard is ever approved. This proposal is an ALTERNATIVE evaluator only.
